      <link>https://m.zhibo8.com//news/web/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f332e28aacnative.htm</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260814/202608142324452744.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260814/202608142324452744_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260814/202608142324452744_720.jpg"> </div><p>【利物浦出售部分股份】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f3c76aa039native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：芬威集团出售利物浦1/3股份给贝索斯所在财团 估值16.5亿镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260815/202608150007202836.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260815/202608150007202836.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260815/202608150007202836.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，芬威集团同意出售少数股份给贝索斯所在财团。泰晤士报、The Athletic等多家媒体报道，利物浦同意出售约1/3股份，交易估值16.5亿镑。</p><p>【转会新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f34871aa5cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">多家媒体：曼城及其他队未提交1.2亿镑报价，恩佐预计留在切尔西</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/6a02f8a718ec9.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/6a02f8a718ec9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/6a02f8a718ec9.jpg"> </div><p>北京时间8月15日0点，切尔西为恩佐设定的转会报价截止期限正式到期。多家媒体报道称，预计恩佐今夏将留队。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-14/6a7f39be73c7dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：马丁内利告知枪手他无意去加拉塔萨雷，此前对方报价4500万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68dd9d312b601.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68dd9d312b601.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68dd9d312b601.jpg"> </div><p>The Athletic独家消息，马丁内利团队告知阿森纳，他无意加盟土耳其球队加拉塔萨雷。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f6da61ef55native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：切尔西与18岁萨特帕耶夫续约至2033年，并租借加盟伯恩利</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260815/202608150349031756_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260815/202608150349031756_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260815/202608150349031756_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，切尔西18岁小将、哈萨克斯坦国脚达斯坦·萨特帕耶夫与俱乐部续约至2033年，并租借加盟伯恩利，双方签下一份为期一个赛季的合约。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f43f642d4fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：弗拉泰西加盟拉齐奥，先租后买1500万欧+国米保留50%二转</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260815/202608150037126677_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260815/202608150037126677_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260815/202608150037126677_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，国米中场弗拉泰西加盟拉齐奥。根据罗马诺报道，租借费500万欧，买断选项1000万欧，国米保留50%二转分成。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f4baaa5c49native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">法媒：皇马希望签苏维门迪，但阿森纳无意放人，除非收到天价报价</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260115/69689cd180da6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260115/69689cd180da6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260115/69689cd180da6.jpg"> </div><p>法媒footmercato报道，皇马希望签下苏维门迪，但阿森纳无意出售球员，除非收到一份天价报价。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f5804aafc2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：切尔西20岁小将凯利曼有望加盟斯特拉斯堡，交易下周敲定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251112/6913819980b24.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251112/6913819980b24.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251112/6913819980b24.jpg"> </div><p>记者Ben Jacobs报道，切尔西20岁中场奥马里·凯利曼有望加盟斯特拉斯堡，相关交易可能于下周敲定。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f486a6c702native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：国米下一目标是琼斯，计划增加浮动奖金来达到4000万欧标价</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260105/695b24e6021fd.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260105/695b24e6021fd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260105/695b24e6021fd.jpg"> </div><p>记者Gianluigi Longari报道，国际米兰转会计划的下一步目标是柯蒂斯·琼斯，弗拉泰西的离队为这位英格兰中场在阵容中腾出了位置。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f8bcc1bbecnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">ESPN：热刺与萨维尼奥达成口头协议，曼城等待对方8500万镑报价</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779708edf103.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779708edf103.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779708edf103.jpg"> </div><p>据ESPN报道，热刺已与萨维尼奥达成口头协议。曼城在等待对方的正式报价。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f95b43ab52native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">太阳报：阿森纳领跑辛谢尔伍德争夺战，但面临曼联、曼城的竞争</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/69e7e569af7fe.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/69e7e569af7fe.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/69e7e569af7fe.jpg"> </div><p>《太阳报》报道，阿森纳领跑布莱顿防守型中场球员辛谢尔伍德的争夺战，但面临曼联、曼城的竞争。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f701c43918native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：AC米兰依然希望出售莱奥，要价可能会下降到4000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260301/69a43953ec0a9.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260301/69a43953ec0a9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260301/69a43953ec0a9.jpg"> </div><p>记者罗马诺的消息，AC米兰依然认为莱奥是可以出售的球员，他们的要价可能会下降到4000万欧元。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-15/6a7f93b14995fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：巴萨认为本周末可敲定罗德里 转会费6500万-7000万欧加奖金</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.24" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260807/6a757ed363af0.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; tex